---
import Legal from "../../layouts/Legal.astro";
import { config, prices, formatPrice } from "../../config";
---
<Legal title="Subscription terms" description="Terms for BuddyAI Care, the subscription that powers the AI assistant (DRAFT, needs legal review).">
  <p>
    BuddyAI Care is the subscription that powers the AI voice assistant on your BuddyAI watch. The watch's assistant
    does not answer without an active BuddyAI Care subscription.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Price and free period</h2>
  <p>
    BuddyAI Care costs {formatPrice(prices.care.GBP, "GBP")} per month (UK) or {formatPrice(prices.care.EUR, "EUR")} per
    month (EU), including VAT. The first {prices.trialMonths} months are free. Your subscription starts when you buy
    the watch; after the free period it renews automatically every month and your card is charged, unless you cancel
    before the free period ends.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Reminder before you are charged</h2>
  <p>
    We will email you before the free period ends, telling you the date of the first payment and how to cancel.
    {/* TODO(owner): make sure this reminder email is actually sent (UK DMCC Act subscription rules). */}
  </p>

  <h2>3. What's included</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Voice conversations with the AI assistant, in all supported languages.</li>
    <li>Personas, custom colours, and your conversation history in your account (export or delete anytime).</li>
    <li>Firmware updates over the air.</li>
    <li>
      A monthly fair-use allowance of AI usage. If you reach it, the assistant pauses until your next monthly period
      starts; we email you when you reach 80% of it.
      {/* TODO(owner): state the allowance in plain terms (e.g. approximate minutes of conversation). */}
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Cancelling</h2>
  <p>
    You can cancel anytime from your account (Plan &amp; usage), which opens our payment provider's secure billing
    portal. The subscription then ends at the end of the current paid period (or of the free period) and you won't be
    charged again. You also have a 14-day right to cancel the subscription from the day the contract starts.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Price changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may change the price with at least 30 days' notice by email. If you don't agree, you can cancel before the new
    price applies.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Failed payments</h2>
  <p>
    If a payment fails we will email you and retry. If it still fails, the assistant stops answering until the payment
    is made.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Service availability</h2>
  <p>
    The assistant relies on our servers and our AI partners (OpenAI) and needs Wi-Fi. We work to keep the service
    available but can't guarantee it will be uninterrupted.
  </p>

  <p>Questions: <a href={`mailto:${config.supportEmail}`}>{config.supportEmail}</a>.</p>
</Legal>
